  "notes": "USAGE:\nA common medical procedure word. Patients encounter this during {健康|けんこう}{診断|しんだん} (health checkups), hospital visits, and blood donation. The procedure is performed by a nurse or phlebotomist.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {献血|けんけつ}: blood donation (giving blood voluntarily for others)\n- {採血|さいけつ}: blood draw (having blood taken for testing)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {採血|さいけつ}する: to draw blood\n- {採血|さいけつ}{室|しつ}: blood draw room\n- {空腹時|くうふくじ}{採血|さいけつ}: fasting blood draw\n- {採血|さいけつ}{結果|けっか}: blood test results",
